        dat("THE WRITE court_justification_commanded — a STATUS on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DK2); the_justification a DATA row (the court's two verbs — 286:2-3); the_strife_of_the_herdsmen a DATA row (the spine's citation of Genesis 13:7 — the tape's own act); the exam's person the litigant who is justified — accepted, the wicked condemned to his lashes")
